BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Digital Life Skills for Seniors: Online Entertainment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260505T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260505T153000
UID:69ab22a3b0595799c0a15d54@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For people who have basic internet skills and want to learn ho
 w to access online videos\, music and magazines.  With your valid Toronto
  Public Library card\, you can access and read popular magazines on your c
 omputer\, tablet or smartphone.  Hoopla offers full length feature movies
 \, television episodes and music albums.  There's so much more and it's f
 ree with your library card.  We also look at free apps and paid subscript
 ion services such as Netflix.  Resource handout provided.\nInformation Co
