DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260519T150000
UID:6988fcb88b29ea2800cecc6c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:What fraud is and how does it work? Learn to identify the sign
 s of fraud and how to act on suspicions Learn about top three scams\, why 
 vulnerable people are targeted. And what to do if you are a victim of frau
 d. Presented by Chartered Professional Accountants of Canada\nCPA Canada 
 has the goal of delivering unbiased objective financial literacy education
  and information to Canadians to improve the overall state of financial li
 teracy in Canada.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
