BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tea & Entertainment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T160000
UID:69e1471c129f12743838fff5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film. Ingredient lists will
  be available upon request.\nMeteor Strike\nA blinding meteor explodes ove
 r Russia\, damaging buildings and sending more than 1\,000 people to the h
 ospital. The Film “Meteor Strike” asks whether Earth is sitting in a 
 cosmic shooting gallery— and how likely it is that a much larger asteroi
 d is headed our way. Closed Captions.60 minutes. 2013
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e1471c129f12743838fff5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
