DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260505T160000
UID:699f6816ec71a31f5b41395e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A Brooklyn woman (Layla Mohammadi) must navigate her relations
 hip with her cultural identity and her boisterous family. When the secrets
  of her life come to light during a family gathering in New York\, she dis
 covers parallels between her life and her mother's.\nR\, 107 minutes\n**Su
 btitles for the Deaf and Hard of Hearing (SDH) when available.
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Adult Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699f6816ec71a31f5b41395e
