DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T150000
UID:69ecc4ca129f1274383abd36@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Calling all Seniors! Whether you are looking for a place to re
 lax\, play some board & card games\, or to just meet other people to talk 
 about sports and politics (or whatever tickles your fancy)\, join us for o
 ur Seniors Social Club!\nThis is a\ndrop-in program\nfor Older Adults. No 
 registration required.\nEvery Thursday from 2:00 - 3:00 pm
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Bagshaw
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ecc4ca129f1274383abd36
