BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tea & Entertainment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T160000
UID:69e148508ddc1caf5f1d6a80@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film. Ingredient lists will
  be available upon request.\nBrain Games: Watch this!\nThis film focuses o
 n how perception and senses shape your reality. You see a number of optica
 l illusions and sensory tricks that reveal how your brain fills in gaps\, 
 misinterprets visual data\, and constructs what you think you’re seeing 
 — even when it’s not accurate. 50 minutes. 2011
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e148508ddc1caf5f1d6a80
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
