UID:69e135f2bd5c392c7644abe2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover Korean mother-of-pearl (najeonchilgi)\, a traditional
  decorative art with centuries of history. Through a short cultural introd
 uction and guided hands-on activity\, participants create a small keepsake
