DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T153000
UID:69e1607db6c4ac1fedcce7fc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover and learn how to do the traditional art of Chinese pa
 per cutting. This 3000 year tradition is a way for people to celebrate nat
 ure and daily life. This program is designed for beginners who will be gui
 ded through making their own beautiful paper designs from simple cuts with
  instructor Jenny Li.\nDrop-in\, no registration required. Program will be
  capped at the first 15 participants.
