DESCRIPTION:Join other book lovers in your community and participate in li
 vely discussions of popular books. This book club will meet every third Tu
 esday of the month for a lively discussion in a welcoming\, relaxed settin
 g. New members are always welcome and encouraged to join.\nJune 16\,\n2026
 \n– Do Not Say We Have Nothing by Madeleine Thien\nWe will be selecting 
 book club titles for the following year.\nCopies of the book are available
  for borrowing at the Fairview Library.\nDrop-in\, no registration necessa
 ry.
