BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Talk About Books
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260528T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260528T150000
UID:698e45fa4a9fd98b7f7dbb25@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for your next great read?\nCome enjoy light refreshmen
 ts as we discuss the monthly list of fabulous books recommended by Runnyme
 de library staff members. A fun and engaging way to discover new authors a
 nd titles and to share what you've been reading with us!
