 ncial future. If you are a low-income earner or advise low-income earners
 \, this program will help you with:\nUnderstanding the Personal Income Tax
  System\nLearn what taxable income is and how tax credits (refundable and 
 non-refundable)\, deductions\, entitlements\, and exemptions can help you 
 reduce your taxable income.\nThis is a drop-in program. Registration is no
 t required.
