DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T190000
UID:69d514cfc1cf6f9a7583b0e7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:An introductory class on Microsoft PowerPoint for absolute beg
 inners.\nIn this first session\, you will:\nCreate\, save\, and run a Powe
 rPoint Presentation\nManipulate and re-order slides\nFormat text and image
 s and apply a design style\nUpon completion of this class\, you will be ab
 le to create and run a simple PowerPoint slideshow.\nPrerequisites: Basic 
 keyboarding and mouse skills required\nFormat:  Hands-on with demonstratio
 ns\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form 
 is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\
 , sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used fo
