DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260525T153000
UID:69de49d94dacf581ff88aa2b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For people who are new to cell phones and want a basic underst
 anding of how to use them. No previous experience is required.  In this co
 urse we will look at:\nThe parts of a cell phone\nSafety tips for using yo
 ur phone\nSkills such as turning off your ringtone\, taking a picture\, se
 nding a text\, and downloading an app\n*Registration is required\nInformat
 ion Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected
