  sharing your thoughts? Our Adult Book Club is the perfect place to meet f
 ellow book lovers and explore new genres together.\nTuesday\, April 7: "\
 nThe Paris Express\n" by Emma Donoghue\nTuesday\, May 5: "\nThe Theory of 
 Crows\n" by David A. Robertson\nTuesday\, June 2: "\nDenison Avenue\n" by 
 Christina Wong\nTuesday\, July 7: "\nThe Marionette\n" by Terry Fallis - A
 uthor will be in the branch to discuss his book\nThis is a drop-in program
 .
