 to learn key information and feel confident for your exam!\nRights and Res
 ponsibilities of Canadian Citizens\nCanadian History\nGovernment and polit
 ical system\nGeography of Canada\nPractice questions and test tips\n"To re
 gister for this program please contact Wen Chen at 647-388-3762 or wchen
 @ccscan.ca"
