DESCRIPTION:New to investing?\nLearn the basics of this important part of 
 financial literacy\, including how to save with the goal of investing\, ty
 pes of investments\, how to open an account\, types of accounts\, how to a
 void financial fraud and scams\, and more.\nPresented by\nCanadian Investm
 ent Regulatory Organization (CIRO)\n\, a national self-regulatory organiza
 tion that oversees all investment dealers\, mutual fund dealers and tradin
 g activity on Canada’s debt and equity marketplaces.\nhttps://www.ciro.c
 a/about-ciro\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on 
