DESCRIPTION:The Culture and Technology Book club brings readers together o
 nce a month to discuss new and classic texts that raise important question
 s about the way technology transforms our cultural and political lives.\nT
 his month we read:\nThe Future is Analog : How to Create a More Human Wor
 ld by David Sax\nDavid Sax\, author of 2016 title “The Revenge of Analo
 g” suggests the Pandemic has offered important lessons in the value of n
 on-digital experiences. He explores how we can (and should) privilege comm
 unity and human experiences over the mediation of digital technologies.\nI
 nformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is co
