DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T170000
UID:69e538424dacf581ff89cddc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Artificial Intelligence (AI) technologies have become increasi
 ngly prevalent in many aspects of modern life\, including healthcare\, fin
 ance\, transportation\, and entertainment. Some examples of AI application
 s include virtual assistants like Siri and Alexa\, self-driving cars\, fra
 ud detection systems\, and personalized recommendations in online shopping
 .\nJoin this beginner in-person class to learn what AI is\, how it learns 
 and predicts outcomes\, considerations when using GenAI applications\, and
  how the Internet of Things (IOT) applies to AI.
