BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tea & Entertainment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260522T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260522T160000
UID:69e1370a2866a5b488490340@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium. Coffee\, tea an
 d cookies or snacks will be served after the film.\nIngredient lists will 
 be available upon request.\nPlanet Earth 3: Freshwater\nFreshwater drives 
 some of Earth’s most remarkable wildlife dramas\, from mass frog breedin
 g and crocodile ambushes to fish that climb waterfalls. Animals adapt to w
 ater that constantly shifts between flood and drought\, creating both extr
 aordinary diversity and peril. But freshwater is scarce and rapidly disapp
 earing\, pushing species like the Indus river dolphin to the brink of exti
 nction. Following the film is a short segment that reveals what happens be
 hind the scenes. Closed captions. 60 minutes. 2024
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e1370a2866a5b488490340
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tea & Entertainment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260605T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260605T160000
UID:69e139c88ddc1caf5f1d6473@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film. Ingredient lists will 
 be available upon request.\nBonnie & Clyde: ‘Til Death Do Us Part (the t
 rue story)\nThis film traces Bonnie Parker and Clyde Barrow from their dif
 ficult childhoods in West Dallas to their violent deaths at a Louisiana ro
 adblock in 1934\, exploring how their romance and crime spree captured the
  public imagination. Though minor criminals by gangster standards\, their 
 dramatic love story and family interviews reveal why they became enduring 
 legends. Closed Captions. 53 minutes.2016
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e139c88ddc1caf5f1d6473
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
